sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Browser
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS Edge Termination
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP HTTP
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend<br/>8000/TCP HTTP<br/>uvicorn (2 workers)
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL 16<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Ollama as Ollama Server<br/>11434/TCP HTTP
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI-compatible API<br/>HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: User Request to Recommendation

    User->>Route: POST /api/v1/recommend<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>No auth required
    Route->>UI: Forward to UI<br/>HTTP/8501 (internal)
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/recommend<br/>HTTP/8000 (internal)<br/>No auth

    Backend->>Postgres: Query benchmark data<br/>PostgreSQL/5432<br/>Auth: POSTGRES_PASSWORD
    Postgres-->>Backend: Benchmark results

    alt LLM_PROVIDER = openai
        Backend->>OpenAI: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS, TLS<br/>Auth: OPENAI_API_KEY
        OpenAI-->>Backend: LLM Response (structured)
    else LLM_PROVIDER = ollama
        Backend->>Ollama: POST /api/chat<br/>HTTP/11434 (internal)<br/>No auth
        Ollama-->>Backend: LLM Response (structured)
    end

    Backend-->>UI: JSON Recommendation Response
    UI-->>Route: Rendered HTML
    Route-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 2: GPU Detection (cached, TTL 300s)

    User->>Route: GET /api/v1/gpu-types<br/>HTTPS/443
    Route->>Backend: HTTP/8000

    Backend->>K8sAPI: List Nodes<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token<br/>(planner-backend SA)
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Node list with<br/>nvidia.com/gpu.product labels

    Backend-->>Route: JSON GPU types (cached)
    Route-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Deploy to Cluster

    User->>Route: POST /api/v1/deploy-to-cluster<br/>HTTPS/443<br/>No auth (WARNING)
    Route->>Backend: HTTP/8000
    Backend->>K8sAPI: Create/Apply resources<br/>HTTPS/6443<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Deployment status
    Backend->>Postgres: Store deployment config<br/>PostgreSQL/5432
    Postgres-->>Backend: Confirmed
    Backend-->>Route: Deployment result
    Route-->>User: HTTPS Response
